---
title: Artists
description: Artist retrieval, discography listing, and management endpoints.
section: Artists
order: 3
method: GET
endpoint: /artists
---

## List Artists

```http
GET /artists?limit=20&offset=0
```

Returns a paginated list of artists in the catalog.

### Headers

- `x-api-key`: `<your_client_api_key>` (or `Authorization: Bearer <key>`)

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
[
  {
    "id": "art_3d8e1f",
    "name": "Tulus",
    "slug": "tulus",
    "image_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/artists/tulus.webp",
    "image_source": "lastfm",
    "created_at": "2024-01-15T08:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "art_9b2c4e",
    "name": "Hindia",
    "slug": "hindia",
    "image_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/artists/hindia.webp",
    "image_source": "deezer",
    "created_at": "2024-02-10T12:30:00Z"
  }
]
```

---

## Get Artist Discography

```http
GET /artists/:id
```

Fetches artist details along with top tracks and albums.

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
{
  "id": "art_3d8e1f",
  "name": "Tulus",
  "slug": "tulus",
  "image_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/artists/tulus.webp",
  "image_source": "lastfm",
  "created_at": "2024-01-15T08:00:00Z",
  "albums": [
    {
      "id": "alb_9c4b2a",
      "title": "Manusia",
      "slug": "manusia",
      "year": 2022,
      "type": "album",
      "cover_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/alb_9c4b2a.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "alb_1a2b3c",
      "title": "Monokrom",
      "slug": "monokrom",
      "year": 2016,
      "type": "album",
      "cover_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/alb_1a2b3c.webp"
    }
  ],
  "top_tracks": [
    {
      "id": "trk_7f9a2b1c",
      "title": "Jatuh Suka",
      "duration": 224,
      "audio_url": "https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/stream/trk_7f9a2b1c/playlist.m3u8"
    },
    {
      "id": "trk_8e2b1a9c",
      "title": "Hati-Hati di Jalan",
      "duration": 242,
      "audio_url": "https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/stream/trk_8e2b1a9c/playlist.m3u8"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## Get Random Artists

```http
GET /artists/random
```

Returns a randomized selection of 6 artists for discover cards.

---

## Count Artists

```http
GET /artists/count
```

```json
{
  "total": 120
}
```

---

## Refresh Artist Image (Master Only)

```http
POST /refresh-image/artists/:id
```

Trigger scraper pipeline to re-fetch high-resolution artist images from Last.fm / Deezer API.

### Headers

- `X-Master-Key`: `<your_master_secret>`

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "artist_id": "art_3d8e1f",
  "new_image_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/artists/tulus.webp",
  "source": "lastfm"
}
```
